WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.215 --> 00:00:10.376
It was a hot day.

2
00:00:16.781 --> 00:00:18.903
Nora opened the freezer and looked inside.

3
00:00:18.923 --> 00:00:23.467
"Dad. There's no ice cream!"

4
00:00:23.707 --> 00:00:24.408
she complained.

5
00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.072
Her father looked up from his computer.

6
00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:32.100
"Do you want to make some?"

7
00:00:33.961 --> 00:00:35.662
"Homemade ice cream!"

8
00:00:36.042 --> 00:00:36.662
Nora cried.

9
00:00:36.682 --> 00:00:39.904
"Yes! Let's get started!"

10
00:00:42.264 --> 00:00:44.846
Nora helped her father gather all the ingredients.

11
00:00:49.407 --> 00:00:49.988
Dad said.

12
00:00:51.048 --> 00:00:52.469
He was looking at a cookbook.

13
00:00:52.489 --> 00:00:56.130
"First we need egg yolks."

14
00:00:57.471 --> 00:01:00.792
Crack! Nora broke some eggs and scooped out the yolks.

15
00:01:06.588 --> 00:01:07.749
She put them in a bowl.

16
00:01:08.329 --> 00:01:09.289
Dad added sugar.

17
00:01:12.831 --> 00:01:14.532
Then he whisked everything together.

18
00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:23.555
Next Dad heated milk and vanilla in a pot.

19
00:01:30.939 --> 00:01:33.680
Then he slowly poured the liquid into the egg yolks.

20
00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.269
Nora stirred everything together.

21
00:01:40.271 --> 00:01:42.312
They cooked the mixture until it got thick.

22
00:01:52.757 --> 00:01:53.238
Dad said.

23
00:01:53.258 --> 00:01:56.720
"What's next?"

24
00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:57.780
Nora asked.

25
00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:02.323
"Now our mixture has to cool," Dad said.

26
00:02:03.643 --> 00:02:04.484
Nora sighed.

27
00:02:05.148 --> 00:02:08.030
"Will it take a really long time?"

28
00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:11.332
"Nope," said Dad.

29
00:02:16.195 --> 00:02:19.536
this." He put the pot in ice water.

30
00:02:19.556 --> 00:02:23.118
"It's cooling fast!"

31
00:02:23.539 --> 00:02:24.119
Nora said.

32
00:02:24.139 --> 00:02:32.784
"Yep." Dad took a cold container out of the freezer.

33
00:02:34.732 --> 00:02:35.672
"What's that for?"

34
00:02:35.913 --> 00:02:36.593
Nora asked.

35
00:02:36.613 --> 00:02:41.095
"It's for an ice cream machine," Dad said.

36
00:02:41.115 --> 00:02:45.156
"The machine will churn the mixture for us."

37
00:02:45.176 --> 00:02:48.638
"Cool!" Nora said.

38
00:02:51.259 --> 00:02:54.120
Dad showed Nora how to put the container into the machine.

39
00:02:57.661 --> 00:03:00.302
He poured in the mixture and Nora added heavy cream.

40
00:03:01.963 --> 00:03:03.724
Then they turned on the machine.

41
00:03:04.844 --> 00:03:06.905
Twenty minutes later Dad turned it off.

42
00:03:14.249 --> 00:03:16.951
He covered the container and put it back into the freezer.

43
00:03:16.971 --> 00:03:20.673
"Here comes the hard part," Dad said.

44
00:03:20.693 --> 00:03:22.494
"We wait!"

45
00:03:27.036 --> 00:03:27.736
Nora groaned.

46
00:03:27.756 --> 00:03:30.778
"I hate waiting."

47
00:03:30.798 --> 00:03:34.280
"Me too," said Dad.

48
00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.741
"So let's try to stay busy."

49
00:03:39.422 --> 00:03:40.962
Dad and Nora played cards.

50
00:03:42.543 --> 00:03:44.204
They kicked a soccer ball around.

51
00:03:46.365 --> 00:03:48.986
They went for a long bike ride through the neighborhood.

52
00:03:51.026 --> 00:03:53.227
Back at home Dad opened the freezer.

53
00:03:55.688 --> 00:03:57.589
Nora stood behind him on tiptoes.

54
00:03:57.609 --> 00:03:59.790
"Is it ready?"

55
00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.191
she asked eagerly.

56
00:04:01.211 --> 00:04:04.432
"Yes!" Dad said.

57
00:04:06.188 --> 00:04:08.129
He scooped some ice cream and they tasted it.

58
00:04:14.612 --> 00:04:15.712
Nora said, grinning.

59
00:04:15.732 --> 00:04:20.054
"I'm glad there was no ice cream in the freezer.

60
00:04:20.635 --> 00:04:23.236
Homemade ice cream is much better!"
